8t9yjVYJVZLUIMn2pBLB0hrB-wUk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9lg5naKjRrE0ScsBYOmGq9vZJ7bURvy9NISpcIHEfx_w&oe=6A26E970"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Traffic Escape - VR Road Crossing Game", "keywords": ["TrafficEscape", "RoadCroosing", "PedestrianCrossing", "CrossingGame"], "long_description": "Step into the thrilling world of Traffic Escape , an immersive road-crossing adventure that puts your reflexes and courage to the test. Navigate through busy highways filled with speeding cars, buses, trucks, and even tractors, each creating unpredictable traffic patterns that demand split-second decisions.\n\nWith realistic VR visuals and heart-pounding sound effects, every crossing feels like a true test of survival. Will you dash forward, wait for the perfect gap, or risk it all for a daring escape? Each level brings new challenges and faster traffic, pushing your skills to the limit.\n\nPerfect for players who love high-stakes action and quick reflex gameplay, Traffic Escape delivers the ultimate road-crossing experience where every step could be your last.", "short_description": "Dodge speeding cars, buses, trucks, and more in Traffic Escape  the ultimate road-crossing challenge where timing and focus mean survival!"}]}, "developer_name": "Abstron Pvt Ltd", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tulipapps.com/meta-quest-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tulip Apps", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.tulipapps.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommende